The Planet Shop is unlocked by completing Easy [[Trials|Trial]] #6.
==Astrodust==
Astrodust is a resource which can be used to buy donuts, unlock Planet Shop features and spent to use some of those features.

Astrodust is obtained by selling zodiacs: to sell a zodiac, place it in the slot next to where "Sell for -" is displayed, then press "Sell for X", where X is the amount of astrodust you will receive.

There are several factors which determine how much astrodust your zodiacs sell for, including: zodiac level, quality, and rarity; {{Keyword|ach|Ach.193|link=achievements}} reward; Relic #005 Wolf Skull effect.

==Donuts==

There are four donuts, each of which provides a different bonus:

{{Keyword|donut_gs|Game Speed}} - Multiplies your Game Speed. Each level will increase your Game Speed mult by +0.01.

{{Keyword|donut_lk|Luck}} - Multiplies your zodiac luck. Each level will increase your luck mult by +0.02.

{{Keyword|donut_ql|Quality}} - Multiplies your zodiac quality. Each level will increase your zodiac quality mult by +0.03.

{{Keyword|donut_xp|Zodiac Exp. Factor}} - Adds a new Factor. Each level will increase the Factor mult by +0.04.

Donuts are upgraded by spending astrodust and a donut's astrodust cost will increase each time it is bought. Donut upgrades persist through {{Keyword|unity|Unities}}.
