==Planet Shop Features==

You can spend astrodust to unlock four new Planet Shop features:

<!-- Keyword currently incompatible with headings; left as is for now but need to fix -Angel-->
=== Merging ===
{{Keyword|ps_merge|Merging}} can be unlocked for 50 astrodust and allows you to insert 3 zodiacs which will be merged to create a new zodiac of the next rarity tier. {{Keyword|ps_merge|Merged}} zodiacs must be of the same element and rarity. If you If you merge 3 of the same Zodiac, the resulting merged zodiac will always be its zodiac. 
<!--If the merged zodiacs have different quality or level values, the created zodiac will... <insert details of how these factor into the resultant quality/level -Angel-->

=== Enhancing === 
{{Keyword|ps_ench|Enhancing}} can be unlocked for 350 astrodust and has a chance to raise the quality of the inserted zodiac, at the cost of astrodust. The higher the quality, the lower the chance of success, and the more astrodust each attempt will cost.
<!--if details are known re: how quality increases (by what % e.g.), add here -Angel-->

=== Redistribution ===
{{Keyword|ps_redist|Redistribution}} can be unlocked for 500 astrodust and will randomize the inserted zodiac's stats, at the cost of astrodust. {{Keyword|ps_redist|Redistributed}} zodiacs have a 1/3 chance of becoming each zodiac of that element and stat values, which stats are present (if the zodiac has less than 4 stats) and the stat order are all randomized.

=== Sacrificing ===
{{Keyword|ps_sac|Sacrificing}} can be unlocked for 10,000,000 astrodust and will {{Keyword|ps_sac|Sacrifice}} the inserted zodiac in order to permanently gain a (small) portion of the zodiac's top/first listed stat.
